<view class="page market-page"><view class="row between"><text class="brand">↗ 转角</text><text class="campus-text">广州校区 · 计算机学院试点</text></view><form bindsubmit="search" class="row search"><input name="q" placeholder="搜索教材、球拍、宿舍好物…"/><button size="mini" form-type="submit">搜索</button></form><view class="native-notice">模拟交易试用 · 不扣真实款项</view><view class="native-channels"><button data-id="electronics" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon green">电</view><text>电子产品</text></button><button data-id="" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon yellow">↗</view><text>推荐</text></button><button data-id="books" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon orange">书</view><text>二手书</text></button><button data-id="living" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon green">家</view><text>宿舍生活</text></button><button data-id="sports" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon purple">动</view><text>运动好物</text></button></view><view class="native-promos"><view class="native-promo warm" data-id="books" bindtap="category"><view class="promo-caption">旧书，也有新故事</view><view class="promo-heading">教材不必买新的</view><view class="promo-caption">按版次找书 · 当面看书况</view></view><view class="native-promo cool" data-tab="community" bindtap="nav"><view class="promo-caption">毕业季 · 轻装出发</view><view class="promo-heading">好物留在华立</view><view class="promo-caption">分享清仓信息，传递好物</view></view></view><view class="row between native-feed-heading"><text>猜你喜欢</text><text class="muted">广州校区 · 校内交付</text></view><button bindtap="toggleFilters">组合筛选</button><view wx:if="{{showFilters}}" class="panel"><view class="field"><text>交付方式</text><picker range="{{deliveryOptions}}" data-field="delivery" bindchange="chooseFilter">{{filters.delivery==='delivery'?'送货（含送货费）':filters.delivery==='pickup'?'自提':'不限交付'}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text>排序</text><picker range="{{sortOptions}}" data-field="sort" bindchange="chooseFilter">{{filters.sort==='price'?'价格从低到高':filters.sort==='price_desc'?'价格从高到低':'最新发布'}}</picker></view><input type="digit" value="{{filters.min_price_yuan}}" data-field="min_price_yuan" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="最低总价（元）"/><input type="digit" value="{{filters.max_price_yuan}}" data-field="max_price_yuan" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="最高总价（元）"/><input value="{{filters.college}}" data-field="college" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="学院完整名称（可不填）"/><input value="{{filters.condition}}" data-field="condition" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="成色，未知填unknown"/><block wx:if="{{!category||category==='books'}}"><input value="{{filters.major}}" data-field="major" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="专业完整名称"/><input value="{{filters.course}}" data-field="course" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="课程完整名称"/><input value="{{filters.edition}}" data-field="edition" bindinput="filterInput" placeholder="版次，如第二版；未知填unknown"/></block><button bindtap="applyFilters">应用筛选</button><button bindtap="clearFilters">清空筛选</button></view><view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image wx:if="{{item.isPhoto}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="cover native-photo" style="{{item.coverStyle}}"><text class="photo-label">AI演示图</text></view><view class="card-content"><view class="title"><text class="pickup-label">{{item.delivery==='delivery'?'可送货':'校内自提'}}</text>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.edition || item.condition}}</view><view class="price">{{item.delivery==='delivery'?'含送货 ¥'+item.delivered:'自提 ¥'+item.priceText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.delivery==='both'?'送货 ¥'+item.delivered:item.delivery==='delivery'?'送货费用已包含':'仅自提'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.region}}</view><view class="seller-line"><text class="seller-avatar">{{item.nickname}}</text></view></view></view></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" bindtap="more">加载更多商品</button><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!products.length}}">还没有匹配商品，欢迎发布第一件好物。</view></view><view class="nav"><button data-tab="community" bindtap="nav">社区</button><button data-tab="cart" bindtap="nav">清单</button><button class="primary" data-tab="publish" bindtap="nav">＋发布</button><button data-tab="messages" bindtap="nav">消息<text wx:if="{{notificationCount}}" class="native-notice-count">{{notificationCount>99?'99+':notificationCount}}</text></button><button data-tab="me" bindtap="nav">我的</button></view>
